supp+=r'\subsection{Descriptor-only interpretability reference}'+'\n'
supp+=panel('si_descriptor_requested',r'\textbf{Descriptor interpretability reference, reformatted from the requested panel.} \textbf{a}, descriptor-only IG category shares from the saved top-15 feature list for each competition assay. \textbf{b}, summed displayed shares by category. \textbf{c--d}, the top four saved descriptor contributions per assay, with complete readable names. Categories do not sum to one because the source table stores only the top 15 features and four displayed categories. The source uses GDPa1 antibodies and a zero raw-feature baseline with a descriptor-only standardized ridge head (without PCA). It is distinct from the new primary-model IG and conditional residue SHAP.','fig:descriptor_legacy')
